      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOYSTROUS (1) settled close to the pace then surged to the lead and maintained the advantage to score in a 1740m race at Riverina Paceway last start, arriving 1.3 metres ahead of his rivals at his first run back from a spell. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Finds a nice race and will be a major force once more. YARRAMAN JOLT (4) finished third last start, beaten 1.5 metres, in a far better performance at Shepparton over 1690m. Tackles a similar assignment and he can go right on with the job. SHIRLEY NOT (2) is on the radar after her last-start sixth over 1750m at Swan Hill a week ago. JILPANGER ROSE (9) is the best of the rest after finishing fifth over 1790m at this track last time out.",
